{#
 # Clearable: wraps a field and shows a clear button while it holds a value.
 #
 # Put a `Clearable:Button` in an `InputGroup:Addon` next to an `InputGroup:Input` (or an `InputGroup:Textarea`),
 # or next to a shadcn `Select` (the button then sits over the trigger, see the Select example).
 # Clearing empties the field, fires `input` and `change` on it, refocuses it and dispatches `clearable:clear`.
 #}
<div
    data-slot="clearable"
    {{ attributes.defaults({
        class: 'contents',
        'data-controller': 'clearable',
        'data-action': 'input->clearable#toggle select:change->clearable#toggle',
    }) }}
>
    {##- A field with a `Clearable:Button`. -#}
    {%- block content %}{% endblock -%}
</div>
